  "description": "A derogatory stereotype implying genetic inferiority or lack of social progress, often used to demean individuals or groups perceived as having poor hygiene, unattractive features, or socially undesirable traits. In this meme, the phrase 'inbred you are' is used as a crude insult targeting the perceived physical appearance or hygiene of the subject, relying on the real-world stereotype that associates certain physical traits with genetic degradation.",
